00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:19.860
Tatlumpung porsyento.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.740
Pero kung gagaling ako hanggang 60 porsyento,

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.340
Kaya ko silang labanan hanggang kamatayan.

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:27.310
Mahalaga ang buhay.

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:29.100
Huwag kang magmadali para isugal ang buhay mo.

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:30.500
Kailangan mong gamitin ito nang mas madalas.

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:31.430
Hoy!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:40.790
Ang pamamaraan na ginagawang pilak ang mga dahon—

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:42.030
